t Thakkar","x":"Just wanted to ask you, maybe pivoting away from the executive order, but on the section 232 tariff investment case, I was just wondering what sort of kind of feedback you have got from your customers on that and kind of given your ability to kind of maybe work with a greater array of different…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/30/nextracker-nxt-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NXT 2026 Q1","e":"nxt","d":"2025-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Brian Lee","x":"I will pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/30/nextracker-nxt-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NXT 2026 Q1","e":"nxt","d":"2025-07-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Chuck Boynton","x":"Our increased outlook is grounded in several key factors, including the strength and diversity of our backlog, a continued flight to quality among solar developers, and the deep capability and commitment of our global team.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/30/nextracker-nxt-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NXT 2026 Q2","e":"nxt","d":"2025-10-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Howard Wenger","x":"We always work very closely with our customers, including managing U.S. Tariff impacts, The tariffs are substantial, as we all know, but impacts are mitigated by our domestic supply chain with over 25 partner manufacturing facilities producing US components and ability to deliver 100% content to…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/24/nextracker-nxt-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NXT 2026 Q2","e":"nxt","d":"2025-10-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Chuck Boynton","x":"We continue to see tariff related headwinds of approximately 300 bps in Q2, up 200 bps over Q1, Our geographic mix diversified supply chain, domestic manufacturing footprint, and disciplined execution have helped offset those impacts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/24/nextracker-nxt-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NXT 2026 Q2","e":"nxt","d":"2025-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Howard Wenger","x":"Pricing continues to track the broader solar cost curve and we continue to invest in R&D, and scalable infrastructure to drive cost out.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/24/nextracker-nxt-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NXT 2026 Q2","e":"nxt","d":"2025-10-23","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Chuck Boynton","x":"Having said that, we have raised our outlook now both Q1 and in Q2.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/24/nextracker-nxt-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NXT 2026 Q3","e":"nxt","d":"2026-01-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Daniel Shugar","x":"Rapid growth in electricity demand driven by economic transformation, mega projects, and the expansion of AI and digital infrastructure calls for solutions that can scale quickly, reliably, and efficiently.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/27/nextpower-nxt-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NXT 2026 Q3","e":"nxt","d":"2026-01-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Howard Wenger","x":"In not only the United States, but around the world with respect to AI electrification, which includes electric vehicles, the data centers that power everything that we do, robotics, the energy requirement for chips is just going up and up.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/27/nextpower-nxt-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NXT 2026 Q3","e":"nxt","d":"2026-01-27","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Chuck Boynton","x":"On a year-to-date basis, adjusted EBITDA increased 22% year over year, demonstrating the durability of our margin profile even as we navigate tariffs and invest in growth initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/27/nextpower-nxt-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NXT 2026 Q3","e":"nxt","d":"2026-01-27","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Chuck Boynton","x":"Moving on to tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/27/nextpower-nxt-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NXT 2026 Q3","e":"nxt","d":"2026-01-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Daniel Shugar","x":"Where there was this cost reduction from the production learning curve effect where every time the cumulative production doubled, cost dropped about 20%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/27/nextpower-nxt-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NXT 2026 Q3","e":"nxt","d":"2026-01-27","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Howard Wenger","x":"We are increasing our outlook for the remainder of the year based on the strength and diversity of our backlog, a continued flight to quality that favors Nextpower Inc., and the deep capability and commitment of our global team.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/27/nextpower-nxt-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NXT 2026 Q3","e":"nxt","d":"2026-01-27","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Dylan Nassano","x":"And then, obviously, you raised the guidance for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/27/nextpower-nxt-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NXT 2026 Q4","e":"nxt","d":"2026-05-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Charles D. Boynton","x":"Gross margins overachieved in Q4, primarily due to tariff recovery, record true capture and U. S. Revenue concentration, partially offset by elevated freight and logistics costs, particularly related to disruptions in The Middle East.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/14/nextpower-nxt-q4-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"NXT 2026 Q4","e":"nxt","d":"2026-05-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Charles D. Boynton","x":"But I guess maybe on the second part of the question here, just the tariff piece of the equation and how you are thinking about that going through the year?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/14/nextpower-nxt-q4-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"NXT 2026 Q4","e":"nxt","d":"2026-05-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Howard J. Wenger","x":"Individual product pricing like trackers continue to align with the broader solar cost reduction curve.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/14/nextpower-nxt-q4-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"NXT 2026 Q4","e":"nxt","d":"2026-05-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Daniel S. Shugar","x":"So there is many different applications, many ways to support these that are being fulfilled And this technology platform is quite scalable, and allows us to right size and provide the right technology for our partner supporting these applications.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/14/nextpower-nxt-q4-2026-earnings-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[59,1,6497,0,0,0,4549,1323],[62,1,6562,0,0,0,4869,1185],[63,1,6427,0,0,0,5076,817],[64,1,6918,0,0,0,5270,1015],[65,1,8313,0,0,0,7350,256],[67,1,7243,0,0,0,5725,1135]],"cinema":[[59,1,6497,0,0,0,4549,1323],[62,1,6562,0,0,0,4869,1185],[63,1,6427,0,0,0,5076,817],[64,1,6918,0,0,0,5270,1015],[65,1,8313,0,0,0,7350,256],[67,1,7243,0,0,0,5725,1135]],"imax":[[59,1,6497,0,0,0,4549,1323],[62,1,6562,0,0,0,4869,1185],[63,1,6427,0,0,0,5076,817],[64,1,6918,0,0,0,5270,1015],[65,1,8313,0,0,0,7350,256],[67,1,7243,0,0,0,5725,1135]],"streaming":[[59,1,6497,0,0,0,4549,1323],[62,1,6562,0,0,0,4869,1185],[63,1,6427,0,0,0,5076,817],[64,1,6918,0,0,0,5270,1015],[65,1,8313,0,0,0,7350,256],[67,1,7243,0,0,0,5725,1135]],"dtc":[[59,1,6497,0,0,0,4549,1323],[62,1,6562,0,0,0,4869,1185],[63,1,6427,0,0,0,5076,817],[64,1,6918,0,0,0,5270,1015],[65,1,8313,0,0,0,7350,256],[67,1,7243,0,0,0,5725,1135]],"ai_spend":[[59,1,6497,0,0,0,4549,1323],[62,1,6562,0,0,0,4869,1185],[63,1,6427,0,0,0,5076,817],[64,1,6918,2,2,0,5270,1015],[65,1,8313,0